+# Password Hashing
+
+This project's recorded decision is to use Argon2id for all password hashing and verification. Argon2id was selected for its memory-hard construction, which provides better resistance to GPU/ASIC-based cracking attacks than the project's earlier choice, and it is the current cryptographic foundation for storing user credentials.
